cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pen2STEP-Bench or these results, please cite the following."
title: "Evaluating an open image-to-CAD model on photographed hand sketches of construction equipment parts"
version: "2.0.1"
abstract: >-
  Pen2STEP-Bench contains 27 hand-drawn three-view sheets with verified ground-truth CadQuery models
  and STEP solids: 19 development sheets drawn by the authors and 8 spare parts of a concrete placing
  boom drawn by a practising engineer outside the author group. The repository holds the sheets, the
  ground truth, the outputs of CAD-Coder run under its released protocol on the 27 sheets and on its own
  100-sample test subset, the recorded generations and offline replay of an earlier configuration, and
  the replay, scoring and statistics scripts behind every table of the accompanying paper.
type: dataset
license: MIT
